	| Quantity                | 1                              |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticFutureStartDate}       |                |
	| Status                  | Cancelled                      |                |
	And I should be able to view a product under the "All" filter with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I should be able to view a product under the "Cancelled" filter with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I should not be able to view a product under the "Active" filter with the name "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive"

